body: "Latest instruction requires every pm package to list pm-cli as an npm dependency. pm-beads was changed to peer/dev only during PR review; restore runtime dependency while keeping release gates green.\n\nVerification complete on 2026-06-12: npm install, npm run build, npm test (59 passing), npm run check, npm run changelog:check, npm run audit:prod (0 vulnerabilities), and npm run pack:dry-run all passed after restoring @unbrained/pm-cli under dependencies at ^2026.6.12.\n\nReview feedback addressed on 2026-06-12: removed redundant @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency so production dependency metadata is unambiguous while retaining runtime dependencies.@unbrained/pm-cli ^2026.6.12 and peerDependencies >=2026.6.12. Re-ran npm install and npm run release:check successfully (typecheck, build, 59 tests, audit:prod 0 vulnerabilities, pack dry-run, changelog check)."
